\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces The gate world by all thirteen controllers. \emph  {Left:} walls passed per episode, labelled with survival to the $128$-step cap. \emph  {Right:} deaths per $100$ steps, labelled with mean episode length. The six deterministic JEPA bars, four planning and two PPO inside the model, sit at the random bar on walls passed; the sampling predictor (purple) leaves it slightly and the two flow-model bars and the real-environment bar leave it entirely. The one empty bar is the sampled heads-MPC, which had not finished.}}{19}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
