\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Craftax-Classic with the grid JEPA under the same budget and off-budget heads, in closed loop: plan towards the latent of a state four actions away and execute, scored by whether the goal position is reached and by the $L_1$ position error at the end of the plan, against a random plan and against an oracle executing the true action sequence. Dashes are cells still in the run queue; the open-loop numbers quoted in Section\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {sec:results-craftax} come from the preliminary study.}}{19}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
